# --- AI / provider credentials: NEVER commit these -------------------------
# The API key is entered at runtime in SMART SETTINGS and stored only in the
# device's private SharedPreferences. This block guarantees no local secrets
# file can ever be committed, even by accident.
.env
.env.*
*.env
secrets.*
*secret*
*credential*
*api-key*
*apikey*
local-ai.properties
ai.properties
nvapi-*
